sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant Rules as Listener Rules
    participant TG as Target Group
    participant EC2 as EC2 Instance

    Client->>ALB: HTTP/HTTPS Request
    ALB->>Rules: Evaluate listener rules (L7)
    Rules->>TG: Route to target group
    TG->>EC2: Forward request
    EC2->>TG: HTTP Response
    TG->>ALB: Return response
    ALB->>Client: HTTP/HTTPS Response
